1️⃣ Which supported API resource is a member of the oauth.openshift.io api-group?
Correct answer: A — groupoauthaccesstokens
Explanation:
Resources in the oauth.openshift.io API group include things related to authentication such as:
•	oauthaccesstokens
•	oauthauthorizationtokens
•	oauthclients
Command to verify:
oc api-resources --api-group oauth.openshift.io
