2️⃣ Which two fields are members of pod.spec.securityContext?
Correct answers:
✅ B — runAsUser
✅ C — sysctls
Explanation:
securityContext defines security settings for pods or containers.
Common fields include:
•	runAsUser
•	runAsGroup
•	fsGroup
•	sysctls
•	seLinuxOptions
Check using:
oc explain pod.spec.securityContext
Incorrect options:
•	readinessGates → pod spec field
•	priorityClassName → pod spec scheduling field
