3️⃣ Which three commands display the conditions of the master01 node?
Correct answers:
✅ A — oc get node/master01 -o json | jq '.status.conditions'
✅ C — oc get node/master01 -o yaml
✅ D — oc get node/master01 -o json
Explanation:
Node conditions are stored in:
status:
  conditions:
Commands that show them:
oc get node master01 -o yaml
oc get node master01 -o json
oc get node master01 -o json | jq '.status.conditions'
Incorrect option:
❌ -o wide → only shows additional columns, not conditions
