4️⃣ Valid condition types for a control plane node
Correct answers:
✅ A — PIDPressure
✅ D — Ready
Common node conditions include:
•	Ready
•	MemoryPressure
•	DiskPressure
•	PIDPressure
•	NetworkUnavailable
Incorrect:
•	DiskIOPressure ❌
•	OutOfMemory ❌
