5️⃣ Valid options for oc adm top pods
Correct answers:
✅ A — -A (all namespaces)
✅ B — --sum (total usage)
✅ D — --containers (per-container usage)
Examples:
All namespaces:
oc adm top pods -A
Show totals:
oc adm top pods -A --sum
Show containers:
oc adm top pods --containers
Incorrect:
❌ --pod-selector (not valid)
________________________________________
6️⃣ Command to determine internal IP of node
Correct answer:
✅ A
oc get nodes master01 -o=jsonpath='{.status.addresses}{"\n"}'
Explanation:
Node IP addresses are stored in:
status:
  addresses:
    - type: InternalIP
Option B shows nodeInfo, not IP.
